hadiths[82]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2417","rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jisne koi jhooti qism jaan-boojh kar khaaii taake kisi musalman ka maal naajaaiz taur par hasil kar ley. to wo Allah Taala ke samney us haalat mein hazir hoga ke Allah paak is par bahut hi ghazabnaak hoga. rawi ne bayan kya ke is par Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! mujh se hi mutaalliq aik masley mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha. mere aur aik Yahudi ke darmyan aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. us ne inkar kya to maine muqaddima Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se malum farmaya, kya tumharey paas koi gawah hai? maine kaha ke nahi. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ke phir to qism khaa. Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye jhooti qism kha lega aur mera maal uda ley jaeyga is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( '' beshak wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon se thodi poonchii khareedtey hain.'' aakhir aayat tak."
"2418","unhon-ne ibne- abii-Hadrad (Raziallahu anhu) se masjid main apne qarz ka taqaza kya aur donon ki awaz itni buland ho gaee ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi ghar mein sun li. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hujra Mubarak ka parda utha kar pukara aey Kab! unhon-ne arz kya, ya Rasulullah main hazir hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne qarz mein se itna kam kar de aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aadha qarz kam kar dene ka ishara kya. unhon-ne kaha ke maine kam kar diya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ibne- abii-Hadrad (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke uth ab qarz ada kar de."
"2419","maine Hishaam-bin-Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) ko sura furqan aik baar us qirat se padhtey suna jo iske khilaf thi jo main padhta tha. halanke meri qirat khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey sikhai thi. qareeb tha ke main fauran hi un par kuchh kar baithoon, lekin maine unhein mohlat di ke wo (namaz se) farigh ho lein. iske baad maine unke galley mein chadar daal kar unko ghaseetaa aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir kya. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke maine unhein us qirat ke khilaf padhtey suna hai jo aap ne mujhey sikhai hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke pahley unhein chhod de. phir unse farmaya ke achchha ab tum qirat sunao. unhon-ne wahi apni qirat sunai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke isi tarah nazil hui thi. iske baad mujh se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab tum bhi padho, maine bhi padh kar sunaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke isi tarah nazil hui. Quran saat (7) qiraton mein nazil hua hai. tum ko jis mein aasani ho isi tarah se padh liya karo."
"2420","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, maine to ye irada kar liya tha ke Namaz ki jamat qaaim karne ka hukm de kar khud un logon ke gharon mein jaun jo jamat mein hazir nahi hotey aur unke ghar ko jalaa dun."
"2421","Zam-aa ki aik baandi ke ladey ke barey mein abd-bin Zam-aa (Raziallahu anhu) aur Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) apna jhagdaa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein lekar gaey. Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! mere bhai ne mujh ko wasiiyat ki thi ke jab main (Makka) aaoon aur Zam-aa ki baandi ke ladkey ko dekhun to usey apni parwarish mein ley loon. kyonke wo unhein ka ladka hai. aur abd-bin-Zam'a ne kaha ke wo mera bhai hai aur mere bap ki baandi ka ladka hai. mere walid hi ke ''faraash'' main uski paidaaish hui hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bachchey ke andar ( Utba ki) waazeh mushabihat (similarity) dekhi. lekin farmaya ke aey Abd-bin-Zam'a! ladka to tumhari hi parwarish mein rahega kyonke ladkaa'' faraash'' ke taabea' hota hai aur Sauda to us ladkey se parda kya kar."
"2422","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand sawaaron ka aik lashkar Najad ki taraf bhejaa. ye log banu-Haneefa ke aik shakhs ko jiska naam Samaama-bin-Assaal tha aur jo ahale-Yamaama ka sardaar tha, pakad laey aur usey masjide-Nabawi ke aik sutoon mein baandh diya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne poochha, samaama! to kis khayal mein hai? unhon-ne kaha aey Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein achchha hun. phir unhon-ne poori hadis zikr ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke Samama ko chhod do."
"2423","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sawaaron ka aik lashkar Najad ki taraf bheja jo banu-Haneefa ke aik shakhs Samaama-bin-Assaal ko pakad laey aur masjid ke aik sutoon se usko baandh diya."
"2424","Abdullah-bin abii-Hadrad Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) par unka qarz tha, unse mulaqat hui to unhon-ne unka peechhaa kya. phir donon ki guftgu tez honey lagi aur awaz buland ho gaee. itney main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka idhar se guzar hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey Kab! aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath se ishara karke maano ye farmaya ke aadhey qarz ki kami kar de. chunanche unhon-ne aadha ley liya aur aadha qarz maaf kar diya."
"2425","main jahiliyat ke zamane mein lohey ka kaam karta tha aur Aas-bin-Waail (kaafir) par mere kuchh rupye qarz they. main uske paas taqaza karne gaya to usne mujh se kaha ke jab tak to Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka inkar nahi karega main tera qarz ada nahi karunga. maine kaha hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka inkar kabhi nahi kar sakta, yahan tak ke Allah Taala tumhen maarey aur phir tum ko uthaaey. wo kehney laga ke phir mujh se bhi taqaza na kar. main jab mar ke dobara zinda hunga to mujhey (doosri zindagi mein) maal aur aulad di jaeygi to tumhara qarz bhi ada kar doonga. is par ye aayat nazil huii ( أفرأيت الذي كفر بآياتنا وقال لأوتين مالا وولدا‏ ) ''tum ne us shakhs ko dekha jisne hamari aayaton ka inkar kya aur kaha ke mujhey maal aur aulad zaroor di jaaeygii.'' aakhir aayat tak."
"2426","maine Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) se mulaqat ki to unhon-ne kaha ke maine so Dinar ki aik thaili (kahiin rastey mein padi hui ( paai . main usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik saal tak uska elaan karta reh. maine aik saal tak uska elaan kya, lekin mujhey koi aisa shakhs nahi mila jo usey pehchan sakta. isliye main phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik saal tak iska elaan karta reh. maine phir ( saal bhar ( elaan kya. lekin unka Malik mujhey nahi mila. teesri martaba hazir hua, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us thaili ki banaawat, Dinar ki tadaad aur thaili ke bandhan ko mehfooz rakh. agar iska Malik aa jaey to ( alamat poochh ke) usey wapas kar denaa, warna apne kharch mein usey istemal kar ley chunanche main usey apne kharchon mein laya. ( Shoba ne bayan kya ke) phir maine Salma se iske baad Makka mein mulaqat ki to unhon kaha ke mujhey yad nahi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( hadis mein) teen saal tak ( elaan karne ke liye farmaya tha) ya sirf aik saal ke liye."
"2427","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik dehati hazir hua aur rastey mein padi hui kisi cheez ko uthaney ke barey mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke aik saal tak iska elaan karta reh. phir iske bartan ki banawat aur uske bandhan ko zahan mein rakh. agar koi aisa shakhs aaey jo uski nishaniyan theek theek bata de (to usey uska maal wapas kar de) warna apni zarooriyaat mein kharch kar. sahabi ne poochha, ya Rasulullah! aisi bakri ka kya kya jaey jiske Malik ka pata na ho? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo ya to tumhari hogi ya tumharey bhai ( Malik ( ko mil jaeygi ya phir bhediye ka luqma banegii. sahaba ne phir puchha aur us oont ka kya kya jaey jo rasta bhool gaya ho? is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehre ka rang badal gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tumhen us se kya matlab? iske sath khud iske khur hain. (jin se wo chalega ( uska mishkeeza hai, pani par wo khud pahunch jaeyga aur darakht ke patey wo khud kha lega."
"2428","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoi hui cheez ke mutaalliq puchha gaya. wo yaqin rakhtey they ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya uske bartan ki banawat aur uske bandhan ko zahan mein rakh, phir aik saal tak uska elaan karta reh. Yazeed bayan kartey they ke agar usey pahchaanney wala (is arse mein) na miley to paaney waley ko apni zarooriyaat mein kharch kar lena chahiye aur ye uske paas amanat ke taur par hoga. us aakhiri tukdey (ke uske paas amanat ke taur par hoga) ke mutaalliq mujhey malum nahi ke ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadis hai ya khud unhon-ne apni taraf se ye baat kahi hai. phir poochha, rasta bhoolii hui bakri ke mutaalliq aap ka kya irshad hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey pakad lo. wo ya tumhari hogi (jab ke asl Malik na miley) ya tumharey bhai (Maalik) ke paas pahunch jaeygi, ya phir usey bhediyaa utha ley jaeyga Yazeed ne bayan kya ke iska bhi elaan kya jaeyga phir sahabi ne poochha, rasta bhooley huey oont ke barey mein aap ka kya irshad hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey aazad rehney do, uske sath uske khur bhi hain aur uska mishkeeza bhi, khud pani par pahunch jaeyga aur khud hi darakht ke pattey kha lega aur is tarah wo apne Malik tak pahunch jaeyga"
"2429","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoi hui cheez ke barey mein sawal kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uske bartan ki banawat aur uske bandhan ko zahan mein yad rakh kar aik saal tak uska elaan karta reh. agar Malik mil jaey (to usey dedey) warna apni zarurat mein kharch kar. unhon-ne puchha aur agar rasta bhuli hui bakri miley? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo tumhari hogi ya tumharey bhai ki hogi. warna phir bhediyaa usey utha ley jaeyga sahabi ne puchha aur oont jo rasta bhool jaaey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tumhen us se kya matlab? uske sath khud uska mishkeeza hai, iske khur hain, pani par wo khud hi pahunch jaeyga aur khud hi darakht ke pattey kha lega aur is tarah kisi na kisi din uska Malik usey khud pa lega."
"2430","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bani-Israeel ke aik mard ka zikr kya. phir poori hadis bayan ki (jo us se pahley guzar chuki hai) ke (qarz dene wala) bahar ye dekhney ke liye nikla ke mumkin hai koi jahaz uska rupya lekar aaya ho. (dariya ke kinarey par jab wo pahunchaa) to usey aik lakdi mili jisey usne apne ghar ke iindhan ke liye utha liya. lekin jab usey chira to usmein rupya aur khat paya."
"2431","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rastey mein aik khajoor par nazar padii. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar iska dar na hota ke sadqe ki hai to main khud usey kha letaa."
"2432","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya main apne ghar jata hun, wahan mujhey mere bistar par khajoor padi hui miltii hai. main usey khaney ke liye utha leta hun. lekin phir ye dar hota hai ke kahin sadqa ki khajoor na ho. to main usey phenk deta hun."
"2433","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Makka ke darakht na kaatey jaaein, wahan ke shikar na chhedey jaaein, aur wahan ke luqtaa ko sirf wahi uthaey jo elaan karey, aur uski ghaas na kaatii jaey. Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! izkhir ki ijazat de dijiye chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne izkhir ki ijazat de di."
"2434","mujh se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ke jab Allah Taala ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Makka fateh kara diya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke samney khadey huey aur Allah Taala ki hamd w sana ke baad farmaya Allah Taala ne haathiyon ke lashkar ko Makka se rok diya tha, lekin apne rasool aur musalmanon ko usey fateh kara diya. dekho! ye Makka mujh se pahley kisi ke liye halal nahi hua tha (yani wahan ladnaa) aur mere liye sirf din ke thodey se hissey mein durust hua. ab mere baad kisi ke liye durust nahi hoga. to iske shikar na chhedey jayen aur na iske kaantey kaatey jaaein. yahan ki giri hui cheez sirf usi ke liye halal hogi jo iska elaan kare. jiska koi aadmi qatl kya gaya ho usey 2 baton ka ikhtiyar hai ya (qaatil se) fidya (maal ( ley ley, ya jaan ke badley jaan ley. Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! izkhir kaatney ki ijazat ho, kyonke ham usey apni qabron aur gharon mein istemal kartey hain. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha izkhir kaatney ki ijazat hai. phir Abu-Shah Yaman ke aik sahabi ne khadey ho kar kaha, ya Rasulullah! mere liye ye khutba likhwaa dijiye, chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba ko hukm farmaya ke Abu-Shah ke liye ye khutba likh do. maine imam Auzai se puchha ke us se kya murad hai ke ''mere liye usey likhwaa diijiye'' to unhon-ne kaha ke wahi khutba murad hai jo unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (Makka mein) suna tha."
"2435","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, koi shakhs kisi doosrey ke doodh ke janwar ko Malik ki ijazat ke baghair na dohey. kya koi shakhs ye pasand karega ke aik ghair shakhs iske godaam mein pahunch kar uska zakheera kholey aur wahan se uska ghalla churaa laaey, logon ke maweshii ke than bhi unke liye khana yani (doodh ke) godaam hain. isliye unhein bhi Malik ki ijazat ke baghair na dohaa jaey."
"2436","aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoi hui cheez ke barey mein poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik saal tak iska elaan karta reh. phir iske bandhan aur bartan ki banawat ko zahan mein yad rakh aur usey apni zarooriyaat mein kharch kar. uska Malik agar uske baad aaey to usey wapas kar de. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne puchha ya Rasulullah! rasta bhoolii hui bakri ka kya kya jaaey? to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey pakad lo, kyonke wo ya tumhari hogi ya tumharey bhai ki hogi ya phir bhediye ki hogi. sahaba ne poochha, ya Rasulullah! rasta bhooley huey oont ka kya kiya jaaey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par ghussa ho gaey aur chehra Mubarak surkh ho gaya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tumhen us se kya matlab? uske sath khud uske khur aur uska mishkeeza hai. isi tarah usey uska asl Malik mil jaeyga"
"2437","main Salmaan-bin-Rabee'a aur Zaid-bin-Sauhaan ke sath aik jihad mein Sharik tha. maine aik kodaa paya (aur usko utha liya ( donon mein se aik ne mujh se kaha ke usey phenk de. maine kaha ke mumkin hai mujhey uska Malik mil jaey. (to usko de doonga) warna khud us se nafa uthaaoonga. jihad se wapas honey ke baad ham ne Haj kya. jab main Madiney gaya to maine Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) se iske barey mein poochha, unhon-ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein mujh ko aik thaili mil gaee thi. jis mein so Dinar they. main usey lekar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik saal tak iska elaan karta rah, maine aik saal tak uska elaan kya aur phir hazir hua. (ke Malik abhi tak nahi milaa) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik saal tak aur elaan kar, maine aik saal tak uska phir elaan kya, aur haazire-khidmat hua. us martaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik saal tak uska phir elaan kar, maine phir aik saal tak elaan kya aur jab chothi martaba hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raqam ke adad, thaili ka bandhan, aur uski saakht ko khayal mein rakh, agar uska Malik mil jaey to usey dedey warna usey apni zarooriyaat mein kharch kar. ham se abdaan ne bayan kya. kaha ke mujhey mere bap ne khabar di Shoba se aur unhein Salma ne yahi hadis, Shoba ne bayan kya ke phir iske baad Makka mein Salma se mila, to unhon-ne kaha ke mujhey khayal nahi (is hadis mein Suwed ne) teen saal tak batlaaney ka zikr kya tha ya aik saal kaa."
"2438","aik dehati ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoi hui cheez ke barey mein poochha, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik saal tak iska elaan karta rah, agar koi aisa shakhs aa jaey jo uski banawat aur bandhan ke barey mein sahi saheeh bataaey (to usey dedey) warna apni zarooriyaat mein usey kharch kar. unhon-ne jab aisey oont ke mutaalliq bhi puchha jo rasta bhool gaya ho. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehre ka rang badal gaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen us se kya matlab? uske sath uska mishkeeza aur uske khur maujood hain. wo khud pani tak pahunch sakta hai. aur ped ke pattey kha sakta hai aur is tarah wo apne Malik tak pahunch sakta hai. unhon-ne rasta bhoolii hui bakri ke mutaalliq bhi poochha, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ya wo tumhari hogi ya tumharey bhai ( asl Malik ( ko mil jaeygi. warna usey bhediyaa utha ley jaeyga"
"2439","( hijrat karke Madina jatey waqt) maine talash kya to mujhey aik charwaha mila jo apni bakriyan charaa raha tha. maine us se puchha ke tum kis ke charwaahey ho? usne kaha ke Quraish ke aik shakhs kaa. us ne qureshi ka naam bhi bataya, jisey main janta tha. maine us se puchha kya tumharey rewad ki bakriyon mein doodh bhi hai? usne kaha ke haan! maine us se kaha kya tum mere liye doodh doh logey? us ne kaha, haan zaroor! chunanche maine us se dohney ke liye kaha, wo apne rewad se aik bakri pakad laya. phir maine us se bakri ka than gard w ghubaar se saaf karne ke liye kaha, phir maine us se apna hath saaf karne ke liye kaha, us ne waisaa hi kya. aik hath ko doosrey par mar kar saaf kar liya aur aik piyala doodh dohaa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye maine aik bartan sath liya tha. jiske munh par kapda bandhaa hua tha. maine pani doodh par bahaya . jis se uska nichlaa hissey thanda ho gaya phir doodh lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya ke doodh hazir hai. ya Rasulullah! pi liijiye, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey piyaa, yahan tak ke main khush ho gaya."
"2440","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jab mominon ko dozakh se nijat mil jaeygi to unhein aik pul par jo jannat aur dozakh ke darmyan hoga rok liya jaeyga aur wahin unke mazaalim ka badla de diya jaeyga jo wo duniya mein aapas mein kartey they. phir jab paak saaf ho jaeinge to unhein jannat mein daakhile ki ijazat di jaeygi. us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, unmein se har shakhs apne jannat ke ghar ko apne duniya ke ghar se bhi behtar taur par pahchaanega. Yoonus-bin-Muhammad ne bayan kya ke ham se Sheban ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne aur unse abu-mutwakkil ne bayan kya."
"2441","main Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein hath diye ja raha tha. ke aik shakhs samney aaya aur puchha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aap ne (qiyamat mein Allah aur bandey ke darmyan honey wali) sargoshi ke barey mein kya suna hai? Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke Allah Taala momin ko apne nazdeek bula lega aur is par apna parda daal dega aur usey chipa lega. Allah Taala us se farmaeyga kya tujh ko falan gunah yad hai? kya falan gunah tujh ko yad hai? wo momin kahega haan, aey mere parwardigaar! aakhir jab wo apne gunahon ka iqrar kar lega aur usey yaqin aa jaeyga ke ab wo halaak hua to Allah Taala farmaeyga ke maine duniya mein terey gunahon par parda daala aur aaj bhi main teri maghfirat karta hun, chunanche usey uski nekiyon ki kitab de di jaeygi, lekin kaafir aur munafiq ke mutaalliq un par gawah (malaaika, anbiyaa, aur tamam jin w insan sab) kahengey ke yahi wo log hain jinhoney apne parwardigar par jhoot baandha tha. khabardaar ho jaao! zaalimon par Allah ki phitkar hogi."
"2442","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aik musalman doosrey musalman ka bhai hai, to is par zulm na karey aur na zulm honey de. jo shakhs apne bhai ki zarurat poori karey, Allah Taala uski zarurat poori karega. jo shakhs kisi musalman ki aik museebat ko door karey, Allah Taala uski qiyamat ki museebaton mein se aik badi museebat ko door farmaeyga aur jo shakhs kisi musalman ke aib ko chhipaaey Allah Taala qiyamat mein uske aib chhipaaeyga."
"2443","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, apne bhai ki madad karo wo zaalim ho ya mazloom."
"2444","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, apne bhai ki madad karo chahe wo zaalim ho ya mazloom. sahaba ne arz kya, ya Rasulullah! ham mazloom ki to madad kar saktey hain. lekin zaalim ki madad kis tarah karein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke zulm se uska hath pakad lo (yahii uski madad hai)."
"2445","hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saat (7) chizon ka hukm farmaya tha aur saat (7) hi chizon se mana bhi farmaya tha (jin chizon ka hukm farmaya tha un mein) unhon-ne mareez ki iyaadat, janazey ke peechhey chalney, chheenkney waley ka jawab dene, salam ka jawab dene, mazloom ki madad karne, dawat karne waley (ki da'wat) qabool karne, aur qism poori karne ka zikr kya."
"2446","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik momin doosrey momin ke sath aik Imaarat ke hukm mein hai ke aik ko doosrey se quwwat pahunchti hai. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne aik hath ki ungliyon ko doosrey hath ki ungliyon ke andar kya."
"2447","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, zulm qiyamat ke din andherey hongey."
"2448","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ko jab (aamil bana kar) Yaman bhejaa, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hidayat farmai ke mazloom ki baddua se dartey rehna ke us (dua'a) ke aur Allah Taala ke darmyan koi parda nahi hota."
"2449","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, agar kisi shakhs ka zulm kisi doosrey ki izzat par ho ya kisi tareeqe (se zulm kya ho) to aaj hii, us din ke aaney se pahley maaf kara ley jis din na Dinar hongey, na dirham, balke agar uska koi nek amal hoga to uske zulm ke badley mein wahi ley liya jaeyga aur agar koi nek amal uske paas nahi hoga to uske (mazloom) sathi ki buraaiyaan is par daal di jaaeingii. Abu-Abdullah (Imam Bukhari (rh)) ne kaha ke Ismaaeel-bin-abii-Ovais ne kaha Saeed Maqbari ka naam Maqbari isliye hua ke qabristaan ke qareeb unhon-ne qiyam kya tha. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ke Saeed Maqbari hi banii-Leis ke ghulam hain. pura naam Saeed-bin-abii-Saeed hai aur (unke waalid) abu-Saeed ka naam kaisaan hai."
"2450","(qur'aan Majeed ki aayat) (وإن امرأة خافت من بعلها نشوزا أو إعراضا) ''agar koi aurat apne shauhar ki taraf se nafrat ya uske munh pherney ka khof rakhti ho'' ke barey mein farmaya ke kisi shakhs ki biwi hai lekin shauhar uske paas zyada aata jata nahi balke usey juda karna chahta hai is par uski biwi kehti hai ke main apna haq tumhen maaf karti hun. usi barey mein ye aayat nazil hui."
"2451","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein doodh ya pani peeney ko pesh kya gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey piyaa . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daain taraf aik ladka tha aur baain taraf badi umr waley they. ladkey se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum mujhey uski ijazat doge ke un logon ko ye ( piyala ( de dun? ladkey ne kaha, nahi Allah ki qasam! ya Rasulullah! aap ki taraf se milney waley hissey ka eisaar main kisi par nahi kar sakta. rawi ne bayan kya ke aakhir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo piyala usi ladkey ko de diya."
"2452","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi ki zameen zulm se ley li, usey qiyamat ke din saat (7) zameenon ka tauq pahnaayaa jaeyga"
"2453","unke aur kuchh doosrey logon ke darmyan (zameen ka ( jhagdaa tha. iska zikr unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se kya to unhon-ne batlaayaa, abu-Salma! zameen se parhez kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, agar kisi shakhs ne aik baalisht bhar zameen bhi kisi doosrey ki zulm se ley li to saat (7) zameenon ka tauq (qiyamat ke din) uske gardan mein daala jaeyga"
"2454","(Abdullaah-bin-Umar (rz)) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jis shakhs ne nahaq kisi zameen ka thoda sa hissey bhi ley liya, to qiyamat ke din usey saat (7) zameenon tak dhansaayaa jaeyga abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ke ye hadis Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ki is kitab mein nahi hai jo khuraasaan mein thi. balke usmein thi jisey unhon-ne Basra main apne shagirdon ko imlaa karaya tha."
"2455","ham kuchh Iraq walon ke sath Madina mein muqeem they. wahan hamein qahat mein mubtala hona padaa . Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) khaney ke liye hamarey paas khajoor bhijwaayaa kartey they. aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) jab hamari taraf se guzartey to farmatey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (doosrey logon ke sath mil kar khaatey waqt) 2 khajoor ko aik sath mila kar khaney se mana farmaya hai magar ye ke tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai se ijazat ley ley."
"2456","Ansar mein aik sahabi jinhein abu-Shuaib (Raziallahu anhu) kaha jata tha, ka aik qasaaii ghulam tha. abu-Shuaib (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha ke mere liye panch aadmiyon ka khana taiyaar kar de, kyonke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko char doosrey ashaab ke sath dawat doonga. unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehra Mubarak par bhook ke aasaar dekhey they. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unhon-ne batlaayaa. aik aur shakhs Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath bin bulaey chala gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saahibe-khaana se farmaya ye aadmi bhi hamarey sath aa gaya hai. kya uske liye tumhari ijazat hai? unhon-ne kaha ji haan ijazat hai."
"2457","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Allah Taala ke yahan sabse zyada na-pasand wo aadmi hai jo sakht jhagdaaloo ho."
"2517","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jis shakhs ne bhi kisi musalman ( ghulam ( ko aazad kya to Allah Taala us ghulam ke jism ke har uzu (ang) ki aazadi ke badley us shakhs ke jism ke bhi eik-eik uzu (ang) ko dozakh se aazad karega. Saeed-bin-Marjaana ne bayan kya ke phir main Ali-bin Husain (Zainul-Aabedeen (rh)) ke yahan gaya (aur unse hadis bayan ki) wo apne aik ghulam ki taraf mutwajjeh huey. jiski Abdullaah-bin-Ja'far das hazaar dirham ya aik hazaar Dinar qeemat de rahe they aur aap ne usey aazad kar diya."
"2518","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kon sa amal afzal hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah par eman lana aur uski raah mein jihad karna. maine puchha aur kis tarah ka ghulam aazad karna afzal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jo sabse zyada qeemtii ho aur Malik ki nazar mein jo bahut zyada pasandida ho. maine arz kya ke agar mujh se ye na ho sakaa? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ke phir kisi musalman kaareegar ki madad kar ya kisi be-hunar ki. unhon-ne kaha ke agar main ye bhi na kar sakaa? is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir logon ko apne shar se mehfooz kar de ke ye bhi aik sadqa hai jisey tum khud apne uper karogey."
"2519","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suraj girahan ke waqt ghulam aazad karne ka hukm farmaya hai. Musa ke sath us hadis ko Ali-bin madeenii ne bhi Abdul-Azeez darawardi se riwayat kya hai. unhon-ne Hisham se."
"2520","hamein suraj girahan ke waqt ghulam aazad karne ka hukm diya jata tha."
"2521","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya 2 saajhiyon ke darmyan saajhey ke ghulam ko agar kisi aik saajhii ne aazad kya, to agar aazad karne wala maaldaar hai to baqi hisson ki qeemat ka andaza kya jaeyga phir (usi ki taraf se) poorey ghulam ko aazad kar diya jaeyga"
"2522","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi mushtarak ghulam main apne hissey ko aazad kar diya aur uske paas itna maal hai ke ghulam ki poori qeemat ada ho sakey to uski qeemat insaf ke sath lagai jaeygi aur baqi saajhiyon ko unke hissey ki qeemat (usi ke maal se) de kar ghulam ko usi ki taraf se aazad kar diya jaeyga warna ghulam ka jo hissey aazad ho chuka wo ho chukaa. baqi hisson ki aazadi ke liye ghulam ko khud koshish karke qeemat ada karni hogi."
"2523","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi mushtarak ghulam ke apne hissey ko aazad kya aur uske paas ghulam ki poori qeemat ada karne ke liye maal bhi hai to pura ghulam usey aazad karaanaa lazim hai lekin agar uske paas itna maal na ho jis se poorey ghulam ki sahi qeemat ada ki ja sakey. to phir ghulam ka jo hissey aazad ho gaya wahi aazad hua. ham se Musaddad ne bayan kya, unse Bishr ne bayan kya aur unse Ubaidullah ne ikhtisar ke saath."
"2524","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi ( saajhey ( ghulam ka apna hissey aazad kar diya. ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) ye alfaz farmaaey (شركا له في عبد) ( shak rawi hadis Ayub sakhtiyan ko hua) aur uske paas itna maal bhi tha jis se poorey ghulam ki munasib qeemat ada ki ja sakti thi to wo ghulam poori tarah aazad samjha jaeyga (baqi hisson ki qeemat usko deeni hogi) Naafe ne bayan kya warna uska jo hissey aazad ho gaya bas wo aazad ho gaya. Ayub ne kaha ke mujhey malum nahi ye (aakhirii tukdaa) khud Naafe ne apni taraf se kaha tha ya ye bhi hadis mein shamil hai."
"2525","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ghulam ya baandi ke barey mein ye fatwa diya kartey they ke agar wo kai saajhiyon ke darmyan mushtarak ho aur aik Sharik apna hissey aazad kar de to ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) farmatey they ke us shakhs par poorey ghulam ke aazad karaaney ki zimme-dari hogi lekin ye is sura mein jab shakhs mazkoor ke paas itna maal ho jis se poorey ghulam ki qeemat ada ki ja sakey. ghulam ki munasib qeemat laga kar doosrey saajhiyon ko unke hisson ke mutabiq adaaeygi kar di jaeygi aur ghulam ko aazad kar diya jaeyga ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ye fatwa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kartey they aur Lais-bin-abii-Zi'ib, ibn-Is'haaq, Juweriya, Yahya-bin-Saeed aur Ismaaeel-bin-Umayya bhi Naafe se us hadis ko riwayat kartey hain, wo Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mukhtasar taur par."
"2526","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne kisi ghulam ka aik hissey aazad kya.''"
"2527","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne kisi saajhey ke ghulam ka apna hissey aazad kya to uski poori aazadi usi ke zimma hai. basharte ke uske paas maal ho. warna ghulam ki qeemat lagai jaeygi aur (us se apne Baqiiya hisson ki qeemat ada karne ki) koshish ke liye kaha jaeyga lekin is par koi sakhti na ki jaaeygii.'' Saeed ke sath us hadis ko hujjaaj-bin-Hujjaaj, Aban aur Moosaa-bin-khalaf ne bhi Qatada se riwayat kya. Shoba ne isey mukhtasar kar diya hai."
"2528","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne meri ummat ke dilon mein paida hone-waale waswason ko maaf kar diya hai jab tak wo unhein amal ya zaban par na laaein.''"
"2529","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aa'maal ka madaar niyat par hai aur har shakhs ko uski niyat ke mutabiq phal milta hai. to jiski hijrat Allah aur uske rasool ke liye ho, wo Allah aur uske rasool ke liye samjhii jaeygi aur jiski hijrat duniya ke liye hogi ya kisi aurat se shadi karne ke liye to ye hijrat mahz usi ke liye hogi jiski niyat se us ne hijrat ki hai.''"
"2530","jab wo Islam qabool karne ke iraadey se (Madina ke liye) nikley to unke sath unka ghulam bhi tha. ( rastey mein) wo donon aik doosrey se bichhad gaey. phir jab Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) (Madina pahunchne ke baad) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein baithey huey they, to unka ghulam bhi achcha aa gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Abu-Hurera ! ye lo tumhara ghulam bhi aa gaya. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, ya Rasulullah! main aapko gawah banata hun ke ye ghulam ab aazad hai. rawi ne kaha ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Madina pahunch kar ye sher kahey they. hai pyari bhale hi kathin hai aur lambi meri raat, par dilai us ne daarul-kufr se mujh ko najaat."
"2531","jab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua tha to aatey huey rastey mein ye sher kaha tha : hai pyari bhale hi kathin hai aur lambi meri raat, par dilai us ne daarul-kufr se mujh ko najaat. unhon-ne bayan kya ke rastey mein mera ghulam mujh se bichhad gaya tha. phir jab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Islam par qaaim rehney ke liye maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait kar li. mein abhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas betha hi hua tha ke wo ghulam dikhai diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Huraira! ye dekh tera ghulam bhi aa gaya. maine kaha, ya Rasulullah! wo Allah ke liye aazad hai. phir maine usey aazad kar diya. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) farmatey hain ke abu-Kuraib ne (apni riwayat mein) abu-Usama se ye lafz nahi riwayat kya ke wo aazad hai."
"2532","jab Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) aa rahe they, to unke sath unka ghulam bhi tha, aap Islam ke iraadey se aa rahe they. achcha rastey mein wo ghulam bhool kar alag ho gaya (phir yahi hadis bayan ki) usmein yun hai aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tha, main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko gawah banata hun ke wo Allah ke liye hai."
"2533","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya Utba-bin- abii-waqaas ne apne bhai Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ko wasiiyat ki thi ke Zam-aa ki baandi ke bachchey ko apne qabzey mein ley lein. usne kaha tha ke wo ladka mera hai. phir jab fateh Makka ke mauqe par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka) tashrif laaey, to Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne Zam-aa ki baandi ke ladkey ko ley liya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey, abd-bin-Zam'a bhi sath they. Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! ye mere bhai ka ladka hai, unhon-ne mujhey wasiiyat ki thi ke ye unhiin ka ladka hai. lekin abd-bin-Zam'a ne arz kya. ya Rasulullah! ye mera bhai hai. jo Zam-aa (mere waalid) ki baandi ka ladka hai. unhiin ke ''faraash'' par paida hua hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zam-aa ki baandi ke ladkey ko dekha to waqei wo Utba ki sura par tha. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey abd-bin-Zam'a! ye tumhari parwarish mein rahega. kyonke bachcha tumharey walid hi ke ''farsh'' par paida hua hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sath hi ye bhi farma diya ke ''aey Sauda-bin-Zam'a ! us se parda kya kar ''ye hidayat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isliye ki thi ke bachchey mein Utba ki shabaahat dekh li thi. Sauda (Raziallahu anha) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi thin."
"2534","ham mein se aik shakhs ne apni maut ke baad apne ghulam ki aazadi ke liye kaha tha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ghulam ko bulaya aur usey bech diya. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir wo ghulam apni aazadi ke pahley hi saal mar gaya tha."
"2535","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 'walaa' ke bechney aur uske hiba karne se mana farmaya tha."
"2536","Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko maine khareedaa to unke maalikon ne 'walaa' ki shart lagai (ke aazadi ke baad wo unhein ke haq mein qaaim rahegii) maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska zikr kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum unhein aazad kar do, 'walaa' to usi ki hoti hai jo qeemat de kar kisi ghulam ko aazad kar de. phir maine unhein aazad kar diya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya aur unke shauhar ke silsiley mein unhein ikhtiyar diya. Barira ne kaha ke agar wo mujhey falan-falan cheez bhi diin tab bhi mein uske paas na rahoongii. chunanche wo apne shauhar se juda ho gaiin."
"2537","Ansar ke kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mulaqat ki aur ijazat chahi aur aa kar arz kya ke aap hamein uski ijazat de dijiye ke ham apne bhaanjey Abbas ka fidya maaf kar dein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi aik dirham bhi na chhodo."
"2538","Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne kufr ke zamaney mein so ghulam aazad kiye they aur so oont logon ki sawari ke liye diye they. phir jab Islam laey to so oont logon ki sawari ke liye diye aur so ghulam aazad kiye. phir unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha. ya Rasulullah ! kuchh un nek aamaal ke mutaalliq aap ka kya khayal hai jinhein main sawab ki niyat se kufr ke zamane mein kya karta tha. unhon-ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ''jo nekiyan tum pahley kar chukey ho wo sab qaaim rahengii.''"
"2540","jab qabila Hawazin ki bhejey huey log (muslmaan ho kar) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey ho kar unse mulaqat farmai, phir un logon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney darkhaast ki ke unke amwaal aur qaidi wapas kar diye jaaein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey (khutba sunaayaa) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum dekhtey ho mere sath jo log hain (mein akelaa hota to tum ko wapas kar detaa) aur baat wahi mujhey pasand hai jo sach ho. isliye 2 chizon mein se aik hi tumhen ikhtiyar karni hogi, ya apna maal wapas ley lo, ya apne qaidiyon ko chhudaa lo, isi liye maine unki taqseem mein bhi der ki thii.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se laut'tey huey (Ja'araana mein) Hawazin walon ka wahan par kai raaton tak intizar kya tha. jab un logon par ye baat poori tarah zahir ho gaee ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 chizon (maal aur qaidi) mein se sirf aik hi ko wapas farma saktey hain. to unhon-ne kaha ke hamein hamarey aadmi hi wapas kar dijiye jo aap ki qaid mein hain. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon se Khattab farmaya, Allah ki tareef uski shaan ke mutabiq karne ke baad farmaya ''ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai hamarey paas naadim ho kar aaey hain aur mera bhi khayal ye hai ke unke aadmi jo hamari qaid mein hain, unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se unke aadmiyon ko wapas karey wo aisa kar ley aur jo shakhs apne hissey ko chhodnaa na chahey (aur us shart par apne qaidiyon ko aazad karne ke liye taiyaar ho ke un qaidiyon ke badley mein) ham usey uske baad sabse pehli maale-ghanimat mein se jo Allah Taala hamein dega iske (is ( hissey ka badla iske hawale kar dengey to wo aisa kar ley.'' log is par bol padey ke ham apni khushi se qaidi ko wapas karne ke liye taiyaar hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ''lekin ham par ye zahir na ho saka ke kis ne hamein ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas jayen aur sab ke zimmedaar aa kar unki raey se hamein aagah karein.'' chunanche sab log chaley aaey aur unke sardaaron ne (unse guftgu ki) phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar di ke sab ne apni khushi se ijazat de di hai. yahi wo khabar hai jo hamein Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke silsiley mein malum hui hai. (Zohri ne kaha) aur Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (jab Bahrain se maal aayaa) kaha tha ke (badr ke mauqe par) maine apna bhi fidya diya tha aur Aqeel (Raziallahu anhu) ka bhii."
"2541","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Banu-Mustaliq par jab hamla kya to wo bilkul ghaafil they aur unke maweshii pani pi rahe they. unke ladney walon ko qatl kya gaya, aurton bachchon ko qaid kar liya gaya. unhiin qaidiyon mein Juweriya (Raziallahu anhu) (ummul-momeneen) bhi thin. (Naafe (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne likha tha ke) ye hadis mujh se Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan ki thi, wo khud bhi Islami fauj ke sath they."
"2542","maine abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha to unse aik sawal kya, aap ne jawab mein kaha ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jange-banii-mustaliq ke liye nikley. us ghazwey mein hamein (qabeela bani mustaliq ke) Arab qaidi hath aaey (raastey hi mein) hamein aurton ki khahish hui aur aurat se alag rehna ham ko mushkil ho gaya. ham ne chaha ke azl kar lein. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us barey mein puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tum azl kar saktey ho, usmein koi qabahat nahi lekin jin ruhon ki bhi qiyamat tak ke liye paidaaish muqaddar ho chuki hai wo to zaroor paida ho kar rahengii (lihaazaa tumhara azl karna bekaar hai)."
"2543","mein banu- Tameem se hamesha mohabbat karta raha hun (doosri sanad imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ( mujh se ibne-Salaam ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko Jarir bin-Abdul-Hameed ne khabar di, unhein Mughira ne, unhein Haris ne, unhein Abu-Zaraa ne aur unhein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne, (teesri sanad) aur Mughira ne Umara se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya, teen baton ki wjah se jinhein maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. main banu- Tameem se hamesha mohabbat karta hun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke barey mein farmaya ke ye log dajjal ke muqaabley mein meri ummat mein sabse zyada sakht mukhalif Sabit hongey. unhon-ne bayan kya ke (eik martaba ( banu- Tameem ke yahan se zakat ( wsool ho kar aai ( to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye hamari qaum ki zakat hai. banu- Tameem ki aik aurat qaid ho kar Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas thi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke usey aazad kar do ke ye Ismail (Alaihissalam) ki aulad mein se hai."
"2544","ham se Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin-Fuzail se suna, unhon-ne Mutarrif se, unhon-ne Shabi se, unhon-ne abu-Barda se, unhon-ne abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se ke jis shakhs k paas koi londi ho aur wo uski achi parwarish karey aur uskey sath achchhaa maamlaa karey, phir usey aazad karkey ussey nikah kar ley to usko dohra sawab milega."
"2545","maine Abu-Zar Ghifari (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha ke unke badan par bhi aik joda tha aur unke ghulam ke badan par bhi usi qism ka aik joda tha. ham ne uski wajah puchha to unhon-ne batlaya ke aik baar meri aik sahib (yani Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) se) se kuchh gali galoch ho gaee thi. unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se meri shikayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se puchha ke kya tum ne unhein unki maa ki taraf se aar dilai hai? phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tumharey ghulam bhi tumharey bhai hain agarche Allah Taala ne unhein tumhari ma-tehti mein de rakha hai. isliye jiska bhi koi bhai uske qabza mein ho usey wahi khilaey jo wo khud khata hai aur wahi pehnaey jo wo khud pehnta hai aur un par unki taqat se zyada bojh na daley. lekin agar unki taqat se zyada bojh dalo to phir unki khud madad bhi kar diya karo."
"2546","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ghulam jo apne aaqa ka khair-khaah bhi ho aur apne rab ki ibadat bhi achi tarah karta ho to usey 2 guna sawab milta hai.''"
"2547","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis kisi ke paas bhi koi baandi ho aur wo usey poorey Husn w khoobi ke sath adab sikhaaey, phir aazad karke us se shadi kar ley to usey 2 guna sawab milta hai aur jo ghulam Allah Taala ke huquq bhi ada karey aur apne malikon ke bhi to usey bhi 2 guna sawab milta hai."
"2548","unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ghulam jo kisi ki milkiyat mein ho aur neko kaar ho to usey 2 sawab miltey hain.'' aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar Allah Taala ke rastey mein jihad , Haj aur walida ki khidmat (ki rok) na hoti to main pasand karta ke ghulam reh kar maroon."
"2549","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' kitna achchha hai kisi ka wo ghulam jo apne rab ki ibadat tamam husno-khubi ke sath bajaa laey aur apne Malik ki khair-khahi bhi karta rahe. ''"
"2550","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab ghulam apne aaqa ki khair-khahi karey aur apne rab ki ibadat tamam husno-khubi ke sath bajaa laey to usey 2 guna sawab milta hai.''"
"2551","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ghulam jo apne rab ki ibadat behtreen tareeqey ke sath bajaa laey aur apne aaqa ke jo is par khair-khahi aur farmaan-bardaarii (ke huquq hain) unhein bhi ada karta rahe, to usey 2 guna sawab milta hai.''"
"2552","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs (kisi ghulam ya kisi bhi shakhs se) ye na kahey. apne rab ( murad aaqa ( ko khana khilaa, apne rab ko wuzu karaa, apne rab ko pani pilaa''. balke sirf mere sardaar, mere aaqa ke alfaz kehna chahiye isi tarah koi shakhs ye na kahey .'' mera banda, meri bandii, balke yun kehna chahiye mera chhokraa, meri chhokrii, mera ghulaam.''"
"2553","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne ghulam ka apna hissey aazad kar diya, aur uske paas itna maal bhi ho jis se ghulam ki waajibii qeemat ada ki ja sakey to usi ke maal se pura ghulam aazad kya jaeyga warna jitna aazad ho gaya ho gayaa.''"
"2554","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se har shakhs Hakim hai aur uski riaya ke barey mein sawal hoga. to logon ka waqei ameer aik Hakim hai aur us se uski riaya ke barey mein sawal hoga aur har aadmi apne ghar walon par Hakim hai aur us se uski riaya ke barey mein sawal hoga aur aurat apne shauhar ke ghar aur uske bachchon par Hakim hai us se uski riaya ke barey mein sawal hoga aur ghulam apne aaqa (saiyed) ke maal ka Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. to jaan lo ke tum mein se har aik Hakim hai aur har aik se uski raiyat ke barey mein (qiyamat ke din) poochh hogi. ''"
"2555","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab baandi zina kiraaey to usey ( bataur had sharaee ( kode lagaao phir agar karey to usey kode lagaao teesri ya chothi baar mein (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) phir usey bech do, chahe qeemat mein aik rassii hi miley.''"
"2557","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke jab kisi ka ghulam khana laey aur wo usey apne sath (khilaaney ke liye) na bitha sakey to usey aik ya 2 niwaaley zaroor khilaa de ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( لقمة أو لقمتين (ke badal ( أكلة أو أكلتين ( farmaya (yani aik ya 2 luqmey ( kyonke usi ne usko taiyaar karne ki takleef uthai hai."
"2558","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''har aadmi Hakim hai aur us se uski riaya ke barey mein sawal hoga. imam Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. mard apne ghar ke maamlaat ka afsar hai aur us se uski riaya ke barey mein sawal hoga. aurat apne shauhar ke ghar ki afsar hai aur us se uski riaya ke barey mein sawal hoga. khaadim apne aaqa (saiyed (ke maal ka muhaafiz hai aur us se uske barey mein sawal hoga.'' unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye baatein suni hain aur mujhey khayal hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya tha ke mard apne bap ke maal ka muhaafiz hai aur usse uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. gharaz tum mein se har fard Hakim hai aur sabse uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga."
"2559","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab koi kisi se jhagdaa karey to chehrey (par maarney) se parhez kare.''"